computing/src/asy/fsm_exercises/README

Using the Finite State machine emulator
  computing/src/scheme/automata/finite-state-machine.rkt
we can use the source code of Finite State machines in the directory
computing/src/scheme/automata/machines, and tape input, to generate
the corresponding computation history, and then run a python file that
converts that history to .asy files of the machine configurations.

Those files are here.  Most of them are for exercises but a few are for the
text body.  Use `make' to create them.
